25120814569.png/3K_aspLAT_DPAVuEwDckdkjfLr7iYiQnniY-aZ4mPmk\"/><figcaption>8種職場工作請託術（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"8種職場工作請託術（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230725/760572533077839872860243.png/XIAl6EznpLE4MtTDiJ9G9dzh7-M3XkWNgBxIbYAcSG0\"/><figcaption>8種職場工作請託術（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"8種職場工作請託術（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230725/760572536030760960201964.png/hFQ5FavEzF2GQHSj0yyCLu_wyVhmB9BS8VH1kPFR9ZA\"/><figcaption>8種職場工作請託術（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>月餅快成時代眼淚？他收禮盒全是餅乾鳳梨酥 網揭2現實考量</p><p>好暖！國小妹生日拿零用錢請全班喝飲料 老闆打5折再加送1杯</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T04:19:18.408620+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1349,"images":35,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}